1	//! Typed calls over one checker session, linked or a `tsc --api` process ([`crate::checker`]). Wire shapes are the
2	//! ones the official 7.1 client sends (traced against `7.1.0-beta`); a method this module does not name is not used.
3	
4	use std::collections::BTreeMap;
